---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Our privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 py-16">
    <article class="glass-card p-8 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mb-6">Last Updated: March 1, 2025</p>

      <p>SecureLoan ("we," "us," or "our") operates as a free matching service connecting consumers with third-party lenders and financial service providers. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding that information.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Identifying Information:</strong> Name, address, ZIP code, email address, phone number, date of birth.</li>
        <li><strong>Financial Information:</strong> Income range, employment status, loan purpose, requested loan amount.</li>
        <li><strong>Device &amp; Usage Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, pages visited, referring URL, and time on site collected via cookies and similar technologies.</li>
        <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Any messages or inquiries you submit through our forms.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To match you with lenders or financial service providers in our network.</li>
        <li>To communicate with you about your inquiry and related offers.</li>
        <li>To improve our website, services, and user experience.</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations, including applicable state and federal laws.</li>
        <li>To prevent fraud and ensure platform security.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">3. Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>We may share your information with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Lender Network Partners:</strong> Third-party lenders, banks, credit unions, and financial institutions who may make you a loan offer.</li>
        <li><strong>Marketing Partners:</strong> We may share data with trusted affiliates who market financial products, subject to confidentiality agreements.</li>
        <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Vendors who assist us in operating our website and business (e.g., analytics, hosting).</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law, subpoena, or to protect our rights.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your personal information to data brokers.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">4. Cookies &amp; Tracking</h2>
      <p>We use cookies, web beacons, and similar tracking technologies to analyze traffic and personalize your experience. You may disable cookies in your browser settings; however, some features of our site may not function properly.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">5. Your Rights (California &amp; Other States)</h2>
      <p>Depending on your state of residence, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or opt out of the sale of your personal information. To exercise these rights, contact us at: <strong>privacy@secureloan.example.com</strong></p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">6. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement industry-standard security measures including SSL/TLS encryption to protect your data. No method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">7. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our services are not directed to individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We will post the revised policy with an updated "Last Updated" date. Continued use of our services after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">9. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at:<br/>
      <strong>SecureLoan</strong><br/>
      123 Financial District Ave, Suite 400, New York, NY 10005<br/>
      Email: privacy@secureloan.example.com</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
